  "content_html": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhjiYJPAm84oR3355jnNlHmNwiPqVmvALUOfbGD4zU52Ki1L4KhkX-u7PehC4FMyNeLEWRp7902hChkHdOJkXbvYISL4fC3sW1R-KGIJ0pmghlHxc-GjbvJnWnrLtbgtAorCJfU9-uyj4NXxingMIUxQOuOLMcckSrr5WGrDqnQRyK-xKVDlJtvJuN8_pQ/w200-h183/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><blockquote><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וַיְהִי כִשְׁמֹעַ לָבָן ... וַיָּרָץ לִקְרָאתוֹ וַיְחַבֶּק לוֹ וַיְנַשֶּׁק לוֹ</span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">רש\"י: ויחבק - שמא זהובים הביא והנם בחיקו. וינשק - שמא מרגליות הביא והם בפיו</span></div></blockquote><h2 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc; font-family: arial;\">🕯️ מעט מן האור</span></h2><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הִזָּהֵר אָחִי:<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מִפְּנֵי לָבָנִים -<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">חַבְּקָנִים,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">נַשְׁקָנִים,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מַשְׁשָׁנִים.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הִשָּׁמֵר בְּנִי:<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מִפְּנֵי אֲרַמִּים -<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">רְכוּשָׁנִיִּים,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">-חָמְרָנִיִּים,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">-הַב-לִי אוֹמְרִים.</span></p><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">📘 עצה שבועית</span></h2><p></p><span data-end=\"167\" data-start=\"145\"><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><p data-end=\"178\" data-start=\"100\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אַל תִּתֵּן גִּישָׁה לְלִבְּךָ - לְמִי שֶׁרוֹצֶה בְּרְכוּשְׁךָ.<br />מִי שֶׁרוֹאֶה אֶת הָאָדָם שֶׁבְּךָ - לֹא יִדְרֹשׁ מִמְּךָ אֶת שֶׁלְּךָ.</span></p></div></span><p></p><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">🌀 הצד השני של המטבע</span></h2><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc; font-family: arial;\"></span></p><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><p>נְשִׁיקַת הַחַמְדָן – נְשִׁיכָה</p></span></div><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">💎 פנינה</span></h2><p><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\"><em data-end=\"817\" data-start=\"765\">\"וַיָּרָץ לִקְרָאתוֹ וַיְחַבֶּק לוֹ וַיְנַשֶּׁק לוֹ\"</em><span data-end=\"817\" data-start=\"765\"> = 1707 =</span><em data-end=\"817\" data-start=\"765\">&nbsp;\"</em></span><em data-end=\"736\" data-start=\"708\" style=\"font-family: arial;\">יֵשׁ רָעָה אֲשֶׁר רָאִיתִי\"</em><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">&nbsp;(קהלת ה׳, י״ב)</span></p><p><br /></p><h2 style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 242, 204); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">📘 מילון ארמי־עברי</span></h2><p style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">חמש מילים מארמית שבתורה - עם פענוח והארה לשונית.</i></span></p><p style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"></p><p style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"></span></p></span><ol style=\"box-sizing: border-box; counter-reset: templateify 0; margin: 10px 0px; padding: 0px 20px 0px 0px;\"><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">'<b>וַיְחַבֶּק</b>' / '<b>וְגָפֵיף</b>'<br /><span><span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">❖ חיבוק חם, הצמדת גוף - גיפוף</span></span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">'<b>מֻצָּב</b>' / '<b>נְעִיץ</b>'<br /><span><span><span style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">❖</span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">&nbsp;שתול, תקוע - נעוץ</span></span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">'<b>וַיִּיקַץ</b>' / '<b>וְאִתְּעַר</b>'<br /><span><span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">❖ קם משנתו, ניעור - התעורר</span></span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">'<b>שֶׁמֶן</b>' / '<b>מִשְׁחָא</b>'<br /><span><span><span style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">❖</span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">&nbsp;שמן למשיחה על הגוף</span></span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">'<b>אוּלָם</b>' / '<b>בְרַם</b>'<br /><span><span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">❖ אך, אבל - ברם</span></span></span></span></li></ol><span><h2 style=\"display: inline; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\"><br /></span></h2><h2 style=\"display: inline; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\"><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"></span></div>👁️ מבט חד</span><br /></h2><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjwNjmq_c3CkS-xXsh6VJXQT_vR-A4R8Pb5sg20YyE-pUhX4YUMlVEAQib3wdf9hf2n20cMM5uRqkTEj_DfI7Nw_9uxDsWeGE5LhyfPHTnDadQOw4UXEm65yymoEKr9Nx11hx2NsjdKr3HlC8gqqynoq1KXgwwkpzlWyeKtD2LMc6FG6hSIi9UYhjOqcSE/s1024/ChatGPT%20Image%20Oct%2015,%202025,%2012_38_36%20PM.png\" style=\"clear: right; float: right; margin-bottom: 1em; margin-left: 1em;\"><img alt=\"שולף שטר כסף מכיס חברו תוך כדי חיבוק\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1024\" data-original-width=\"1024\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjwNjmq_c3CkS-xXsh6VJXQT_vR-A4R8Pb5sg20YyE-pUhX4YUMlVEAQib3wdf9hf2n20cMM5uRqkTEj_DfI7Nw_9uxDsWeGE5LhyfPHTnDadQOw4UXEm65yymoEKr9Nx11hx2NsjdKr3HlC8gqqynoq1KXgwwkpzlWyeKtD2LMc6FG6hSIi9UYhjOqcSE/w200-h200/ChatGPT%20Image%20Oct%2015,%202025,%2012_38_36%20PM.png\" width=\"200\" /></a></div><br /><div><br /></div><br /></span><br /><br /></div></div>"
}
